# VSCode
.vscode/
!Firmware/motherBoard/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json

# PlatformIO / builds
.pio/
**/.pio/
build/
**/build/
.pio/build/
**/.pio/build/
build/
**/build/
**/preproc/
**/includes.cache
*.log
*.map
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.bin
